of sheaves\n<MATH_0006>\ncompatible with the glueing maps <MATH_0007>. Similarly,\nto give a morphism of sheaves <MATH_0008>\nis the same as giving a collection of morphisms of sheaves\n<MATH_0009>\ncompatible with the glueing maps <MATH_0010>.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:339eebdea40ead50d969a4bbf22eeb9746fb4b556401b81fe2a29b1b0b4fe259", "unit_id": "inventory:sheaves:00AK:paragraph/0004"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:79f879fa177345fcdc4e27fbe88df553f8536d01f28e3bc79aa67a7715ddd517", "hash": "sha256:79f879fa177345fcdc4e27fbe88df553f8536d01f28e3bc79aa67a7715ddd517", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 184132, "byte_start": 183936, "file": "sheaves.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:3f85aab3ba47f504c5389e3f0b19112732ffd69af12e8dc2e96527468a18c673", "line_end": 5310, "line_start": 5305}, "owner_tag": "00AN", "parent_tag": "00AK", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "00AK", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-glue-maps}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-glue-sheaves}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:50aa9ada6955e443bd90f002c4b16a43ef483896deb5dc56f848145f1337cdfb", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nThe functor is fully faithful by\nLemma <REF_0001>\nand essentially surjective (via an explicitly given quasi-inverse functor) by\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:49466e0bd7c783409cc5702efd984e121e599f7ef087197cefa7bf7210e43191", "unit_id": "inventory:sheaves:00AN:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:df02b83e625352c4020a4b4e0020568dca631cd8f2c1717cfa885cd9584f5a91", "hash": "sha256:df02b83e625352c